---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
	title="About Me"
	description="Who I am, what I can and can't do yet, and why I'm doing this."
>
	<h1>About Me</h1>

	<p class="lede">
		Learn about who I am, what I can and can't do yet, and why I am doing this.
	</p>

	<section aria-labelledby="can-heading">
		<h2 id="can-heading">What I can do today</h2>

		<ul>
			<li>Provision an Ubuntu server and work on it with Claude Code over SSH.</li>
			<li>Register a domain, serve a site over HTTPS with Let's Encrypt certificates, and harden SSH access.</li>
			<li>Work in Git — branches, pull requests, and merges — with the history public on GitHub.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="cannot-heading">
		<h2 id="cannot-heading">What I cannot do yet</h2>

		<ul>
			<li>I've never landed a paying customer. Closing that starts with asking people I already know, and doing one job cheap to have something real to show.</li>
			<li>I've never operated a business. Closing that means registering as a sole trader, getting a CVR number, and learning to invoice properly.</li>
			<li>I've never priced my own work. Closing that means finding out what small businesses here actually pay for a website, and testing a number on real prospects.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="why-heading">
		<h2 id="why-heading">Why I am doing this</h2>
		<p>
			I want to build something of my own, and turn it into a business. Someone told me early on that owning something beats working under someone, and it stuck. AI is going to keep growing, and I want to be early to something that's going to matter. Learning to work with AI is how I find out whether any of my ideas hold up — or at least learn from the failures.	
		</p>
	</section>
</Base>

<style>
	.lede {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}
</style>
